# content-structure

The documentation site employs a hierarchical content organization system with the following key components:

Content Collections:
- Documentation sections are organized into Astro content collections
- Navigation structure is defined through configuration rather than hard-coding
- New documentation sections are automatically integrated via the content collection system

Section Integration Flow:
1. Documentation files placed in content collections
2. Automatic sidebar generation based on folder structure
3. Navigation hierarchy derived from file frontmatter metadata
4. Documentation sections rendered using the Starlight theme templates

Primary Structure:
```
/src/content/docs/
  ├── getting-started/
  ├── reference/
  ├── guides/
  └── api/
```

Technical Importance Scores:
- Content Collection Organization: 65
- Navigation Structure: 45
- Section Integration: 40

